<title>USA: Conn. University $39 mln deal won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Conn. University $39 mln deal won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said Tuesday it won $39.2 million Connecticut Health and Educational Facilities Authority revenue bonds, for the Connecticut State University System, at a true interest cost of 5.319 percent.</p>
</text>
